Step 2	piper-tts conflicts with sample generator	Remove piper-tts from install
Step 3	--no-deps skips microWakeWord's dependencies	Remove --no-deps flag
Steps 8/9	fma_16k/audioset_16k empty, crashes augmentation	Download background audio or set AddBackgroundNoise: 0.0
Step 10	Wrong HuggingFace zip filenames → 404	Verify actual filenames on HuggingFace and add HTTP error checking
Step 11	features_dir path too shallow	Point to generated_augmented_features/training
Step 11	minimization_metric: None → YAML null	Change to "" or remove key
The biggest blockers in order are: the empty background dirs (Step 9 crash), the wrong HuggingFace filenames (Step 10 crash), and the missing --no-deps issue (Step 9 import crash). Fix those three and you should get much further into the pipeline.

